{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00187",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 6.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Okay, so hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.97,
      "end_seconds": 10.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.95,
      "end_seconds": 20.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed. Uh, we came because of a little chest discomfort."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.99,
      "end_seconds": 25.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.29,
      "end_seconds": 29.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "It's been six months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.85,
      "end_seconds": 32.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Does anything make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.15,
      "end_seconds": 49.26,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "I mean, resting helps a bit. Oh, you know, I've also had a bit of dizziness with the new tablets, for about three months. Yeah, with bit of dizziness with the new tablets, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.78,
      "end_seconds": 53.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Okay, has there been poor sleep too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.56,
      "end_seconds": 55.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Yeah. Six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.45,
      "end_seconds": 60.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "What about ankle swelling in the evenings, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.22,
      "end_seconds": 63.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.4,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.0,
      "end_seconds": 77.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.91,
      "end_seconds": 82.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Have you had any pain at rest, black stools or bruising?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.16,
      "end_seconds": 87.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, no pain at rest, black stools or bruising."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.19,
      "end_seconds": 90.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "What about palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.42,
      "end_seconds": 92.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "No. No palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 93.5,
      "end_seconds": 97.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.08,
      "end_seconds": 103.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.47,
      "end_seconds": 112.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.36,
      "end_seconds": 114.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.83,
      "end_seconds": 119.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.81,
      "end_seconds": 123.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.02,
      "end_seconds": 129.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.96,
      "end_seconds": 135.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.09,
      "end_seconds": 137.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.32,
      "end_seconds": 145.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "I've got diabetes. I've got high blood pressure. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 152.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.38,
      "end_seconds": 157.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.39,
      "end_seconds": 173.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.89,
      "end_seconds": 185.57,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Clopidogrel. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. I take Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. Ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 186.71,
      "end_seconds": 194.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the ramipril was 2.5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.66,
      "end_seconds": 199.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.86,
      "end_seconds": 203.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "No, um, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.81,
      "end_seconds": 210.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.92,
      "end_seconds": 214.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'm allergic to codeine, I get vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.63,
      "end_seconds": 216.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.38,
      "end_seconds": 225.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.4,
      "end_seconds": 248.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.5 degrees, respiratory rate 17. And saturation 97 percent, pressure 127 over 72, heart rate 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.37,
      "end_seconds": 250.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.28,
      "end_seconds": 256.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.09,
      "end_seconds": 262.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.7,
      "end_seconds": 267.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Alright, just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.14,
      "end_seconds": 280.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Chest is clear and heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.16,
      "end_seconds": 284.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.48,
      "end_seconds": 306.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "The scar on your chest has healed well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.34,
      "end_seconds": 318.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.91,
      "end_seconds": 321.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Right, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.52,
      "end_seconds": 323.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.3,
      "end_seconds": 345.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like stable recovery after the heart event. I can't rule out medication side effects yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.58,
      "end_seconds": 351.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Oh, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.81,
      "end_seconds": 366.44,
      "duration_seconds": 14.63,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now stable recovery after the heart event is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a little chest discomfort for six months, and no pain at rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.02,
      "end_seconds": 368.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.83,
      "end_seconds": 373.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.67,
      "end_seconds": 374.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.7,
      "end_seconds": 401.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. We should do an ECG for follow-up. I'm going to order an echocardiogram, for follow-up. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.27,
      "end_seconds": 405.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, um, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.65,
      "end_seconds": 410.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a lipid profile for cardiovascular risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.8,
      "end_seconds": 414.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Right, um, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.48,
      "end_seconds": 435.21,
      "duration_seconds": 18.73,
      "text": "I'd like you to take atorvastatin, 40 milligrams, at night, long term. That should help with cardiovascular risk. Cardiac rehab is worth doing, it really helps your confidence. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. We'll refer you to cardiac rehabilitation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.61,
      "end_seconds": 438.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.61,
      "end_seconds": 446.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 447.2,
      "end_seconds": 449.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.78,
      "end_seconds": 458.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Let's review you in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 460.11,
      "end_seconds": 461.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.96,
      "end_seconds": 470.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 473.56,
      "end_seconds": 481.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "So, I take the atorvastatin, 40 milligrams, at night and come back in three months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 482.36,
      "end_seconds": 487.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 488.28,
      "end_seconds": 493.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Well, um, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}